title: "NASA Exoplanet Archive stellar densities stored in the wrong unit"
abstract: "A physical self-consistency check of every parameter set in the NASA Exoplanet Archive found that stellar densities from four references, led by 1,414 rows from Fulton & Petigura 2018, are in solar units, although the column is documented in g/cm³. Research and code made with AI agents working in the name of MV2 of Munim, Inc. Code licensed Apache-2.0; text and data CC BY 4.0 unless a file says otherwise."
